The fan thresholds are 28 and 26 °C. The temperature is read as 25, 28, 27, 26, 29 in turn. What does this code print?

```cpp
float t[] = {25, 28, 27, 26, 29};
bool fan = false;

void setup() {
  Serial.begin(9600);
  for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) {
    if (t[i] >= 28.0) fan = true;
    else if (t[i] <= 26.0) fan = false;
    Serial.print(fan ? 1 : 0);
  }
}
void loop() {}
```

